  m_Name: Reitor 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  lines:
  - text: 'First, in the Engineering Building, several pieces of equipment were damaged. '
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: "The labs can\u2019t continue operating like this, so we need you to repair
      them as soon as possible."
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: "Second, the building\u2019s central AI system is malfunctioning. "
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: Because of that, the cooling systems are unstable, and several automatic
      doors are no longer opening properly.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
